    "description": "UI mesh of the waterfall sheet and its support; waterfall_model.obj is a hand-imported export (millimetres, Y-up, base on y=0, oriented via the model instance transform)",
    "units": "millimetres, like dome_model.obj -- the model instance scales by 0.01 to reach scene units (mm -> m is /1000, scene units are metres * 10)",
    "orientation": "Y-up as exported, so unlike dome_model.obj it needs no pitch. The sheet hangs on the mesh's -X side, so the model yaws it onto the dome's -Z back to match the Waterfall LED fixture."
  },
